# JavaScript Basics – TryHackMe Lab

## 📌 Overview
This repository contains my practical learning and hands-on exercises from the JavaScript Basics room on TryHackMe.

The lab introduces fundamental JavaScript concepts and demonstrates how JavaScript is used in web development and basic scripting.

## 🎯 Objectives
- Understand JavaScript fundamentals.
- Learn variables and data types.
- Explore operators and expressions.
- Understand conditional statements.
- Practice functions and basic scripting.
- Learn how JavaScript interacts with web pages.

## 🛠️ Topics Covered
- JavaScript Introduction
- Variables (`var`, `let`, `const`)
- Data Types
- Operators
- Conditional Statements (`if/else`)
- Loops
- Functions
- Console Output (`console.log()`)

## 💻 Practical Exercises
Performed basic JavaScript exercises to understand syntax, execute scripts, work with variables, and practice logical operations.

## 📸 Lab Screenshots
Screenshots of completed tasks and practical exercises are included in this repository.

## 📚 Learning Outcome
Gained a basic understanding of JavaScript syntax, programming logic, and scripting fundamentals through hands-on practice.

